         {
          "h_title": "Book Your\nSite Visit",
          "main_title": "CRAFTED FOR\u2028COMFORT",
          "author": "Elite Pods",
          "language": "en",
          "level": 3,
          "primary_content": [
           {
            "text": "Get in touch with us to arrange a convenient time for a site visit. We\u2019ll come to you, see your space, and get a feel for what\u2019s possible.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           }
          ],
          "secondary_content": null,
          "table_content": null
         },
         {
          "h_title": "Design & Select Your Pod",
          "main_title": "CRAFTED FOR\u2028COMFORT",
          "author": "Elite Pods",
          "language": "en",
          "level": 3,
          "primary_content": [
           {
            "text": "We\u2019ll discuss your needs and style, exploring colours, finishes, and features. We\u2019ll ensure everything suits your space.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           }
          ],
          "secondary_content": null,
          "table_content": null
         },
         {
          "h_title": "Site\nAnalysis",
          "main_title": "CRAFTED FOR\u2028COMFORT",
          "author": "Elite Pods",
          "language": "en",
          "level": 3,
          "primary_content": [
           {
            "text": "On-site, we\u2019ll check practical details to fit your pod perfectly. We\u2019ll assess plumbing and electrical needs for readiness.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           }
          ],
          "secondary_content": null,
          "table_content": null
         },
         {
          "h_title": "Place Your\nOrder",
          "main_title": "CRAFTED FOR\u2028COMFORT",
          "author": "Elite Pods",
          "language": "en",
          "level": 3,
          "primary_content": [
           {
            "text": "Once happy with the design, we\u2019ll finalize your order. A deposit secures your pod, and we\u2019ll manage logistics.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           }
          ],
          "secondary_content": null,
          "table_content": null
         },
         {
          "h_title": "Delivery & Installation",
          "main_title": "CRAFTED FOR\u2028COMFORT",
          "author": "Elite Pods",
          "language": "en",
          "level": 3,
          "primary_content": [
           {
            "text": "A crane will place your pod. Our team will ensure everything is ready for you. Crane hire is not included.",
